  "document": "Maianthemum\nMaianthemum (Latin \"Māia \" \"May\" and Greek \"ánthemon \" \"flower\"; including former \"Smilacina\") is a genus of rhizomatous, herbaceous, perennial flowering plants, native to the understory of woodlands. It is widespread across much of North America, Europe and Asia."
